Light up your home with pure magic this season thanks to this Christmas tree from HOMCOM. Its artificial design will last you for several years, and it is safe placed in the home with children and pets. It's made with fibre-optic LED lights for a bright and beautiful look. The branches are able to support your hanging decorations and tinsel for a customized look. A beautiful way to create an extra-special feeling in your home.



• Beautiful green artificial Christmas tree with hundreds of tiny fibres which dance through the colour spectrum; 

• Multi coloured fibre optics and LED snowflakes on the branches and a large multicoloured star at the top; 

• Mains operated tree, a 220-240V 50/60Hz transformer included; 

• Some basic home assembly is required; 

• The PVC tips are fireproofing, so it is secure for family use;

• Base houses a single lamp which generates the stunning, colour changing fibre optic effect;

