Add festive charm to your outdoor space with this 2-piece lighted Christmas tree set. Featuring a compact tree body, green PVC tips and a ground-insert design, these trees are easy to place in your garden. Each Xmas tree is pre-lit with colourful LEDs in a steady-on mode and powered by 3 AA batteries (not included), while the manually expandable tips make setup simple. With an IP44 rating and flame-retardant PVC, these trees create a cheerful and convenient holiday display.



● 2-piece set with a compact ground-insert design, featuring 60 cm tree bodies and 16 cm stakes for easy outdoor placement;

● Colourful LED lights create a cheerful, festive glow in steady-on mode;

● Battery-powered with 3 AA batteries per Christmas tree (not included), requiring no nearby power outlet for flexible decorating;

● Flame-retardant PVC tips add extra safety and peace of mind to your seasonal display;

● The IP44-rated design is suitable for outdoor holiday decorating;

● Single-section trunks and manually expandable tips make setup and shaping simple;

● Designed for outdoor use, suitable for gardens, patios, porches and yards to create a festive Christmas atmosphere;

