The most magical time of the year got even more special. This frosted Christmas tree, from HOMCOM, is a wonderful way to enjoy the season with your family. It's covered with faux-snow on all the tips for your own Winter wonderland with all the family. Formed of full and realistic tips, the plastic structure is strong enough to hold decorations and tinsel. Little mess, simple assembly and creating your own impeccable ambience will make this season more magical than ever.



● White-painted ends for a snow-dipped look;

● Plenty of branches for a full and realistic look;

● Metal base included for to keep standing steady;

● Tall top branch for star/angel;

● Comes in easy-to-fix-together pieces for easy assembly and storage;

● Recommended to spend 25-30 minutes fluffing the branches once pieces are fixed together;

