Bring natural forest elegance home with this artificial Christmas tree. Featuring dense PE and PVC branch tips for realistic volume and vibrant colour, it is supported by a strong metal base. Designed with a pre-attached hinged structure for quicker setup and crafted with flame-retardant materials, it provides cosy seasonal charm for young and fluffy friends.



● Moulded PE outer tips combined with dense PVC foliage create a full, realistic silhouette;

● Generous wide design offers a traditional evergreen shape with lush foliage;

● Pre-attached hinged system allows branch tips to drop open automatically during assembly;

● Flame-retardant PE and PVC foliage deliver high fire safety for family living spaces;

● Strong metal base and sectioned trunk provide reliable balance and stability;

● Sectioned structure enables straightforward setup and compact off-season storage;

