● Tips covered in white: a beautiful snowy design; 

● Pencil shape: slimline so it fits snugly in small spaces or entryways;

● Bare design to dress up with whatever decorations and lights you want;

● Flame retardant plastic: stable and safe;

● Metal base so fake Christmas tree stands upright and steady;

● Easy to set up. Just fit the sections together and spread the branches on this realistic Christmas tree;

